          <row><entry align="left"><para>identity / <literal>cpu_​arc</literal></para></entry><entry align="left"><para>Device cpu architecture (CPU architecture string not in any standard IANA MIB.)</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>1.​3.​6.​1.​4.​1.​66630.​1.​1.​1.​1.​1 (onvif​Cpu​Arch)</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>ONVIF-MIB</para></entry></row>
          <row><entry align="left"><para>health / <literal>avg_​power_​consumption</literal></para></entry><entry align="left"><para>Average power consumption (in watts) (Device exposes this value directly (e.g. AXIS 9.8W); RFC 3621 has no average power object.)</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>1.​3.​6.​1.​4.​1.​66630.​1.​1.​1.​2.​1 (onvif​Avg​Power​Consumption)</para></entry><entry align="left"><para>ONVIF-MIB</para></entry></row>
